Track 2: "Is the coin return jammed?"
- Story & Context: Elara stands by the entrance of the abandoned cinema, her fingers tracing the jagged edges of a hollowed-out coin slot while she wonders why she is the only one who can still hear the phantom hum of the mall’s power grid. She confesses to the crowd that she has been feeding her own memories into the circuit, watching them turn into binary code that no one can decrypt. "I am just a ghost trapped in the copper feed."
